{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026P0MaY4tYe01793070459.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》今集帶大家遊走兩大充滿悠閒度假風情的好去處！首站由張與辰帶領蔡景行（行仔）入長洲感受離島慢活步伐兼掃街；隨後再由黃嘉雯載著廖慧儀前往屯門黃金海岸，品嚐精緻地道的越南佳餚。</p><p>長洲離島慢活掃街之旅</p><p>張與辰表示鍾情長洲有山有海的放鬆氛圍，並直言每次入長洲必備「大魚蛋、歎茶、食甜品」三部曲：</p><ul><li><p><strong>激辣大魚蛋</strong>：碼頭旁小食店的大魚蛋共有8款口味。嗜辣的與辰點了最辣的「麻辣」及「冬蔭功」口味，令未能吃辣的行仔食到滿面通紅兼狂飆汗。行仔秉持專業死忍堅持拍攝，最終獲導演喊停遞上紙巾，與辰事後補刀笑言「唔覺得辣」，場面搞笑。</p></li><li><p><strong>山系 Café</strong>：兩人隨後到一間山系Café Chill一番，品嚐了店內的招牌甜品「髒髒朱古力雞蛋布甸撻」。</p></li><li><p><strong>芒果糯米糍元祖店</strong>：最後一站來到首間開發芒果糯米糍的老店。該店高峰期曾日賣過千粒，糯米糍軟熟且芒果甜美多汁。與辰特別品嚐了「鴛鴦芒果腸粉」，黑白外皮分別為芝麻皮及椰汁皮，口感煙韌不黏牙，內含半隻香濃的貴價呂宋芒，份量十足。</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"5deb5631-c881-4323-9049-e95f5ea2cbba.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260I2U7DTaL41793070458.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"14e81563-d371-4f29-9517-5f7e170857cc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026t6FLnGjmr21793070458.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"03896c2e-b805-49aa-870f-0d2e5a16a82b.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026RaLUSAgvVo1793070460.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>屯門黃金海岸地道越南菜</p><p>第二站黃嘉雯與廖慧儀來到屯門黃金海岸的越南菜館「Bistro Hoi An」，享受充滿異國風情的美食：</p><ul><li><p><strong>越南鮮蝦豬肉煎薄餅</strong>：煎薄餅金黃酥脆，食客可利用店家提供的特製米紙及豐富配料自由DIY包裹餡料，口感豐富且極具互動樂趣。</p></li><li><p><strong>會阿娜烤乳豬</strong>：特別採用160度與200度的「雙段火候」精心烘烤，精準平衡鮮嫩肉質與極致酥脆的豬皮，入口脂香四溢。</p></li><li><p><strong>河內生牛肉湯河</strong>：靈魂湯底嚴選大量牛骨慢火熬製長達12小時，甘醇濃郁；順滑的河粉掛湯力極強，搭配油脂香濃的嫩牛肉，令人大呼過癮。</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"0ee47dba-bac3-4a19-aaa8-d43477a79d8a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026PZnoVpdWf71793070460.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ee65df3a-8d5d-4c04-ac91-77cdd214b1ad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026CxPFVkQb9A1793070460.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ed440637-81a8-468c-9f57-f20233bbc98a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026bDPsGHzh1n1793070459.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"326d0863-6725-42d0-8455-28e742153d9d.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dotTi3OWGR1793070459.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.741689+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":677,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T19:18:08.816087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:21.788775+00:00","content_hash":"a92bf1f58d6019f5371e9f2b5c6e3e6a56342312eda27432f923d9450b94a5eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.741689+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}